# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps secrets out of it.
# Anything sent to the daemon can end up in an image layer.

**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/.vscode
.git
.github

# The API references none of these. Copying the WebAssembly project in particular would
# add a multi-minute build for something the image never serves.
UpcsgWeb.FrontEnd/
UpcsgWeb.Domain.Tests/
_content-backup/
scripts/
publish/
*.md
